## Non-Negotiable Constraints

All 7 tools MUST follow:
- `Fraction` only, 0 floats — all ratios, scores, thresholds as `Fraction`
- `Tuple[bool, ProofObject]` returns where applicable (scope_audit, anti_nominalism, merkle_verify)
- Dual `Falsifies if:` / `falsifies_if:` in all docstrings
- No `pass` bodies, no stubs, no placeholders
- Runnable with `python3 <script>` from repo root, stdlib + `fractions` only
- Each tool writes JSON report to `audit/` directory
- Each tool has a `--help` flag via `argparse`
- Commit format: `feat(audit): add <tool_name>`
- Record consent in `consent_log.jsonl` before starting
- Run existing verification quartet before AND after all changes [9-cite-4](#9-cite-4) [9-cite-5](#9-cite-5) [9-cite-6](#9-cite-6) 

